  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit",
    "Season the lamb pieces with salt, black pepper, and ginger",
    "Heat the olive oil in the ceramic tagine over medium heat",
    "Sear the lamb pieces until browned on all sides",
    "Add the garlic, lemon juice, and chicken broth to the tagine",
    "Cover the tagine with a lid and transfer it to the preheated oven",
    "Bake for 2.5 hours or until the lamb is tender",
    "Remove the tagine from the oven and let it cool for 10 minutes",
    "Serve the lamb and sauce hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired"
